    NB ['randomize'] blank on BOTH. For `randomize` the reason is ESTABLISHED and it is not the colon rule: with the fence on its OWN numbered line it is still blank, so `RANDOMIZE 1` never RETURNS on either machine -- it blocks, agreeing, and this instrument cannot say anything about its line handling. Any OTHER tag appearing here has not been explained and must be before it is read as agreement.
